      "role": "user",
      "content": "The Senator's part is good, but the activist feels a bit one-dimensional. Can you expand on their argument? I want the activist to have some actual points about the long-term dangers of surveillance, but keep them sounding a bit frantic and less structured than the Senator so it fits the character dynamic I described. It's important that the Senator stays the 'voice of reason' in the scene.",
